{
  "_help": [
    "Scenery behind each stage. 'themes' is keyed by the stage's build id from campaign.json (level:streets, boss:pell, keep ...);",
    "'default' is used for any stage without an entry. Colours are [r,g,b]. Every colour has an astral twin that fades in when the",
    "player shifts. Layers draw back to front. factor = how fast it scrolls sideways compared to the camera (0 = fixed, 1 = with the world).",
    "Layer kinds: skyline (buildings with lit windows), arches (colonnade), columns (hanging pillars), stars, mist, moon (baseY=x, minH=y).",
    "Common numbers: baseY (ground line on screen), spacing, minH/maxH, minW/maxW, seed (change for a different arrangement),",
    "windows / density (0-1), drift (self-scroll speed), lit / astralLit (window and star colour)."
  ],
